        "cooked": "<p>I just opened my lovely Sentinel Tactics care package and everything looks great. &nbsp;I noticed, however, a few minor imperfections (white dots) on Ra and Tachyon's panels. &nbsp;It's just cosmetic, but enough to bother my inner obsessive-compulsive. &nbsp;Does anyone else have these same dots? &nbsp;It would make me feel better to know that it's part of the design/a flaw in the whole run rather than just in my panels.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
